  "question": {
    "text": "The number of solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> in the interval <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>]</mo></math> is<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(Not possible)</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(reject as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>)</p><p>So, number of solutions is one.</p>"
  }
